Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 22:47:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Fix confused deputy in Bluetooth settings dashboard

The Bluetooth dashboard incorrectly trusted any caller from the Settings
package itself. On multi-pane devices, a deep link trampoline causes
external requests to appear as if they came from Settings.

This change uses getInitialCallingPackage() to correctly identify the
original caller and only enable AlwaysDiscoverable mode for trusted
system callers.

